  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Against Child Exploitation (ACE) Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ACE seeks to strengthen governments and communities in Asia to address the worst forms of child labor, including the online sexual exploitation of children, and promote acceptable conditions of work through a unified and participatory approach, beginning with action in the Philippines.</narrative>
  </description>
